  "2026-11-09T17:10:31.571Z","harness:codex","Confirmed direct formatter reproduction after the declared-domain repair: no-domain normalized argv --pm-path /selected context --depth invalid and fields --pm-path,--depth still produce example pm --pm-path brief context --depth invalid. This owner remains open and unclaimed; no fix to that legacy branch is claimed in PR #1696. The active PR prevents the equivalent inference whenever complete or malformed producer domain metadata is supplied."
